{%- comment -%}
  PDP Product Details — two columns: prose on the left, a stack of collapsible
  info rows on the right (Price Calculator, Features, Guarantee, Pressing…).

  Data sources (both fall back to the theme editor settings/blocks so the
  section still renders on products that have no metafields yet):

    Left prose  → product.description
    Right rows  → product.metafields.custom.details_json

  details_json accepts either shape:

    [ { "label": "Features", "body": "<p>…</p>" }, … ]

  or, when you also want to override the left column:

    {
      "heading": "Product Details",
      "body": "<p>…</p>",
      "subheading": "Super Vivid Prints. No Upcharge.",
      "subbody": "<p>…</p>",
      "rows": [ { "label": "Features", "body": "<p>…</p>" }, … ]
    }

  `body` may contain HTML. Each row may also carry "open": true to render it
  expanded on load.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign dj = product.metafields.custom.details_json.value
  assign dj_rows = nil

  if dj != blank
    if dj.rows
      assign dj_rows = dj.rows
    elsif dj.size > 0 and dj.first.label
      assign dj_rows = dj
    endif
  endif

  assign d_heading = section.settings.heading | default: 'Product Details'
  if dj.heading != blank
    assign d_heading = dj.heading
  endif

  assign d_body = section.settings.body
  if product.description != blank
    assign d_body = product.description
  endif
  if dj.body != blank
    assign d_body = dj.body
  endif

  assign d_subheading = section.settings.subheading
  assign d_subbody = section.settings.subbody
  if dj.subheading != blank or dj.subbody != blank
    assign d_subheading = dj.subheading
    assign d_subbody = dj.subbody
  elsif product.description != blank and dj.body == blank
    comment
      The product description already carries the whole left column, so the
      static sub-copy from the editor would duplicate it.
    endcomment
    assign d_subheading = blank
    assign d_subbody = blank
  endif
-%}

<section class="pdp-details">
  <div class="pdp-details-inner">

    <div class="pdp-details-copy">
      <h2 class="pdp-details-title">{{ d_heading }}</h2>
      <div class="pdp-details-body rte">{{ d_body }}</div>

      {%- if d_subheading != blank -%}
        <h3 class="pdp-details-sub">{{ d_subheading }}</h3>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if d_subbody != blank -%}
        <div class="pdp-details-body rte">{{ d_subbody }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="pdp-acc">
      {%- if dj_rows != blank -%}
        {%- for row in dj_rows -%}
          {%- assign acc_id = section.id | append: '-acc-' | append: forloop.index -%}
          <div class="pdp-acc-item">
            <input class="pdp-acc-toggle" type="checkbox" id="{{ acc_id }}"{% if row.open %} checked{% endif %}>
            <label class="pdp-acc-btn" for="{{ acc_id }}">
              <span class="pdp-acc-label">{{ row.label }}</span>
              <span class="pdp-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
              </span>
            </label>
            <div class="pdp-acc-panel"><div class="pdp-acc-panel-inner rte">{{ row.body }}</div></div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- assign acc_id = section.id | append: '-acc-' | append: forloop.index -%}
          <div class="pdp-acc-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <input class="pdp-acc-toggle" type="checkbox" id="{{ acc_id }}">
            <label class="pdp-acc-btn" for="{{ acc_id }}">
              <span class="pdp-acc-label">{{ block.settings.label }}</span>
              <span class="pdp-acc-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg>
              </span>
            </label>
            <div class="pdp-acc-panel"><div class="pdp-acc-panel-inner rte">{{ block.settings.body }}</div></div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP Product Details",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Left column comes from the product description. Right column comes from the product metafield custom.details_json. The settings and blocks below are only used as a fallback when those are empty." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Product Details" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body (fallback)", "default": "<p>Experience professional-grade DTF printing made effortless with Fineyst Transfers. Every transfer is produced using our VIVID+ DTF process, featuring an expanded CMYK + RGBO + White ink system that delivers dramatically brighter colors, smoother gradients, and sharper detail - at no extra cost. From vibrant colors and clean whites to fine lines and complex gradients, our high-quality DTF transfers give shops, brands, and creators the freedom to print virtually any design on any garment with consistently standout results.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Sub heading (fallback)", "default": "Super Vivid Prints. No Upcharge." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "subbody", "label": "Sub body (fallback)", "default": "<p>Most DTF providers still use 5-color printing as their standard. Accessing 9-color printing typically requires a paid upgrade, often increasing costs by up to 50%.</p><p>Fineyst includes 9-color VIVID+ printing on every DTF order at no additional cost.</p>" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "name": "Info row",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "PDP Product Details",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Price Calculator", "body": "<p>Pricing is calculated per square inch, so you only pay for the space your design uses. Volume discounts apply automatically at 15, 50, 100 and 250 pieces - up to 50% off.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Features", "body": "<p>9-color VIVID+ printing, 16.7 million colors, near-perfect Pantone matching, bright opaque whites, 100+ wash durability, and fine detail down to 3 pixels. Works on cotton, polyester, blends, canvas, denim and nylon.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Specialty DTF Styles", "body": "<p>Beyond standard DTF we print puff, glitter, glow-in-the-dark, reflective, metallic foil and UV DTF. Each specialty style ships press-ready with its own pressing card.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Satisfaction Guarantee", "body": "<p>If a transfer does not press correctly or arrives with a print defect, we reprint it free. No return shipping, no restocking fee, no argument.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Pressing Instructions", "body": "<p>Press at 300-320°F for 10-15 seconds with medium pressure, then peel. Peel temperature depends on the transfer type and is printed on the card that ships with every order.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Shipping & Returns", "body": "<p>Most orders are printed and shipped within 24 hours. Free shipping on qualifying US orders. Because every transfer is made to order we cannot accept returns, but our reprint guarantee covers any defect.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Art Upload Recommendations", "body": "<p>Upload PNG with a transparent background at 300 DPI for best results. We also accept PDF, AI, SVG, TIFF and JPG. Our art team reviews every file free and will flag anything that will not print cleanly.</p>" } },
        { "type": "row", "settings": { "label": "Names & Numbers", "body": "<p>Building team apparel? Use the Gang Sheet Builder to lay out names and numbers on a single sheet, then press them one at a time. No per-name setup fee.</p>" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
